{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1465"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge music-stage/pop-rock","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/music-stage__pop-rock.g4.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",527],["+"," Rubin's two protégés were soon sharing a stage as well: in 1987 Run-DMC and the Beastie Boys – the former's name now usually written without the dots – teamed up for the Together Forever Tour, a joint tour of American arenas that showed how far rap had travelled from the block party."],["=",458]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",521],["+"," Bald teilten sich Rubins zwei Schützlinge auch die Bühne: 1987 gingen Run-DMC und die Beastie Boys – der Name der ersten wird heute meist ohne Punkte geschrieben – gemeinsam auf die Together Forever Tour, eine Tournee durch die Hallen Amerikas, die zeigte, wie weit der Rap seit der Blockparty gekommen war."],["=",460]]}]},
